sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WIP as TM Bundle Folder<br/>WIP_MM_* file
    participant WIPProv as WipBundleRunningPoProvider
    participant Q as FileBasedPoChangeQueue
    participant FBW as FileBasedPoChangeWorker
    participant POWF as PoEndWorkflowService
    participant ENG as NdtBundleEngine
    participant STATE as NdtBundleRuntimeStateStore
    participant CSV as CsvBundleOutputWriter
    participant REPO as NdtBundleRepository
    participant TRACE as TraceabilityRepository
    participant ZPL as NdtZplTagPrinter
    participant PRN as NetworkPrinterSender
    participant SQL as SQL Server

    participant SMW as SlitMonitoringWorker
    participant S7NDT as S7MillNdtCountReader
    participant PLC3 as S7 PLC Mill-3

    participant PHW as PlcHandshakeWorker
    participant HS as PlcHandshakeService<br/>(per mill)

    Note over WIP,PRN: Path A — File-based PO change (FileBasedPoEnd.Enabled=true)

    WIP->>WIPProv: FileSystemWatcher Created/Renamed<br/>OnFsEvent (WipBundleFileName.TryParse)
    WIPProv->>WIPProv: TryApplyRunningPoUpdateUnsafe<br/>PO A → PO B detected
    WIPProv->>Q: TryEnqueue(FileBasedPoChangeRequest)<br/>one in-flight per mill
    Q-->>FBW: Channel ReadAllAsync

    FBW->>FBW: ProcessRequestAsync<br/>ResolveEndedPoFallbackAsync if needed
    FBW->>POWF: ExecuteAsync(endedPo, millNo)
    POWF->>ENG: HandlePoEndAsync(po, mill, onBundleClosed)
    ENG->>STATE: EnsureInitializedAsync / GetSizeCounts
    loop each partial size count
        ENG->>STATE: CloseBundle(po, mill, count)
        ENG->>CSV: onBundleClosed → WriteBundleAsync
    end
    POWF->>STATE: SaveAsync (JSON state file)
    POWF->>WIPProv: NotifyPoEndForMill → WaitingForNewWip=true

    CSV->>CSV: File.WriteAllLinesAsync<br/>NDT_Bundle_{batch}.csv
    CSV->>REPO: RecordBundleAsync (3 retries)
    REPO->>SQL: Upsert NDT_Bundle
    CSV->>ZPL: PrintBundleTagAsync
    ZPL->>ZPL: ZplNdtLabelBuilder.BuildNdtTagZpl
    ZPL->>PRN: SendAsync(host, 9100, zplBytes)
    PRN->>PRN: TcpClient.ConnectAsync (10s timeout)

    FBW->>WIPProv: TrySetRunningPoFromWipFile(newPo)
    FBW->>Q: MarkCompleted(millNo)

    Note over SMW,SQL: Path B — Input Slit bundle (every PollIntervalSeconds=5)

    loop every 5s
        SMW->>SMW: ProcessNewSlitFilesAsync<br/>LastWriteTimeUtc dedup
        alt Mill-3 single slit row + MillSlitLive
            SMW->>S7NDT: TryReadNdtPipesCountAsync
            S7NDT->>PLC3: plc.Open() sync S7 read DB251@6
            S7NDT-->>SMW: plcNdt (display column only)
        end
        SMW->>ENG: ProcessSlitRecordAsync(bundleRecord)
        ENG->>STATE: GetSizeCounts → mutate → SetSizeCounts → SaveAsync
        alt count >= formation threshold
            ENG->>CSV: WriteBundleAsync (bundle close)
            CSV->>REPO: RecordBundleAsync
            CSV->>ZPL: PrintBundleTagAsync
        end
        SMW->>CSV: Write output slit CSV + NDT Batch No column
        SMW->>TRACE: RecordInputSlitRowsAsync / RecordOutputSlitRowsAsync
        TRACE->>SQL: per-row INSERT (no transaction)
    end

    Note over PHW,HS: Path C — PLC telemetry (TelemetryOnly=true, poll 500ms)

    loop each mill task
        PHW->>HS: RunAsync loop
        HS->>HS: EnsureConnectedAsync (S7 reconnect + backoff)
        HS->>HS: TryUpdateDb251Counts<br/>OK/NOK/NDT/PO_Id/Slit_Id
        alt Mill-1 hooter enabled
            HS->>HS: TryUpdateMillSignalsAsync<br/>ProcessHooterPulse → Q6.7
        end
        Note right of HS: Rising-edge PO trigger ignored<br/>when FileBasedPoEnd enabled
        HS->>HS: Task.Delay(PollIntervalMs)
    end
